 Keyboard Help                                        v1.2.3
 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 every key taskmgr-ui answers to
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Moving and opening ───────────────────────────────────────
   up / down            the row above / below
   enter                open the selected issue in Detail
   esc                  back to where the surface was opened

 Tabs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   tab/ctrl+pgdown      next tab: Board, Docs
   shift+tab/ctrl+pgup  previous tab

 Mouse ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   click                select a row, switch to a tab, press
 down/up scroll • esc back • pgup/pgdown page • home/end bo…